OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled during this period with
OL,7,Fspells of rain or showers and stronger
OL,8,Fwinds mixed with some drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter intervals. Less cold than of
OL,10,Flate.
